  "title": "Boba Fett on the Offensive",
  "description": "With the Rodian dead and the massif tossed out into the dunes, Boba Fett, still chained-up, is next in line. The Tusken Raider jabs the sand ape in its foot, and the beast responds with a quick and brutal punch, and then gives Fett the same furious treatment. Looking for some sort of retribution, the sand ape chases down the Tusken youth, catching up to him and hoisting him into the air. Boba, not far behind, climbs the back of the monster, chain still in hand, and chokes the fearsome creature out."
